---
description: Prototyping kit structure and where agent material lives
alwaysApply: true
---

This is a prototyping kit with four top-level, peer folders you may read and manage:

- `Code/` — the full prototype codebase
- `Docs/` — human-level documentation and resources
- `Export/` — drop zone for built prototype artifacts (write, don't hand-edit)
- `Agents/` — agent-facing skills, context, and prompts

Before acting, consult the agent material — it is the source of truth:

- Front door: `AGENTS.md` (repo root)
- Index: `Agents/README.md`
- Conventions & background: `Agents/context/`
- Reusable capabilities: `Agents/skills/`
- Task templates: `Agents/prompts/`

Keep this rule thin: put durable guidance in `Agents/` and reference it here rather than
duplicating it.
